msgctxt "452"
msgid "Pardon me, sir... Could I ask for a bit of your time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "Cos'è?"

msgctxt "476"
msgid "This may sound strange, but are you the type to keep a secret?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Not all the time. Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Never mind. Sorry I called you over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Sure. I've always been good at keeping secrets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "I see. I need someone who can keep his mouth shut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Is this some kind of con?"
msgstr "È una specie di scherzo?"

msgctxt "548"
msgid "No, no. I really mean it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Then what's the deal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"I've been looking for a man like you who can keep things discreet to do me a"
" favor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "What kind of favor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"You've heard of the famous actress Makiko Takahashi, yes? She's won awards "
"overseas as best leading female and has really put Japan on the map in "
"cinema."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "I can't say that I have. What about her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Well, it's just that Ms. Takahashi craves a vibrant night life. So much so "
"that she's known as the Kamurocho Queen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"She goes out on the town every night here for drinks, and recently she's "
"become very well acquainted with the top host of this host club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Today she wants to have drinks with him at her place, which is all well and "
"good, but with her recent fame, candid photos could be damaging."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"If they can make it to their taxi on Park Boulevard without getting "
"photographed, everything should be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Would you work as a bodyguard for Ms. Takahashi and her host friend? We'll "
"pay you for your trouble, of course!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "I don't think so. Find somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"You seem perfect for the job, though. Please let me know if you change your "
"mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "All right. I'll usher them to the taxi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Thank you, sir! The paparazzi has been watching her every move lately, "
"trying to snap photos that could harm her career."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "In fact, there's some damn paparazzi right over there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"What I'd like you to do is chase away any paparazzi who might snap a photo "
"of Ms. Takahashi and her host friend walking together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I'm sure they're hiding in various cracks and crevices like rodents, so do "
"your best to hunt them down and chase them away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"So you want me to keep those nosy photographers out of Ms. Takahashi's "
"business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"That's exactly right. I'm going to bring her out now, so please do your "
"best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"So you're the stud who's been hired to keep the paparazzi off my back? I "
"hope you're as strong as you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Keep us safe from those vultures, usher boy. Makiko-chan means the world to "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "......"
